    "summary": "Bearer: a **WATCH MASTER** or **TECHMARINE** model.\n\nAs [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, pick an enemy **VEHICLE** unit, not a **TITANIC** unit, up to 12\" from the bearer and [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to it. That unit takes a [Leadership test](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls):\n\n- if it passes, attacks by its models get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase\n- if it fails, it cannot shoot for the rest of the phase",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
        "title": "Warhammer 40,000: The App",
        "appVersion": "2.6.0",
